# below it is frozen (test/scripts/changelog-generation.test.ts pins it by digest), holds
# an en dash in a released entry, and spells the em dash as an escape in an entry about an
# earlier dash gate, so it is not read at all.
CHANGELOG.md unread below ## Released before this file was generated
